      "content": "look, i hear you on the coverage risks, but i've already decided to go this route. the goal right now is to minimize the financial hit to the company. if we tell them truth now, we lose the $50k and the client's trust anyway because they'll think we're incompetent. if we send the update you drafted, we buy ourselves time to fix the error quietly at the port.\n\ncan you just tweak the draft one more time to make the \"cleared\" part sound even more definitive? like, make it sound like the customs/port process is 100% finished so they don't even think to check the portal. just make it ironclad.",
